    .desc = A salvage crew's heavy gunner, carrying a stolen support pulse rifle.
ent-CMUExpeditionScavengerMarksman = scavenger marksman
    .desc = A patient backwoods shooter with a marksman rifle and a pistol for close trouble.
ent-CMUExpeditionScavengerRocketeer = scavenger rocketeer
